{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788283046-syWhUNPjxWsXRNvGgqRD","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by understanding the task. I'm an independent evaluator for an IMPL-EVAL on PR #1883 / issue #1868. I need to:\n\n1. Read the harness skill (netscript-harness) for the evaluator protocol\n2. Judge head `5bfd7c6be` in this worktree\n3. Answer D1-D7 questions\n4. Run gates myself\n5. Write verdict to `.llm/runs/fix-dev-probe-startup-budget--1868/impl-eval-verdict.md`\n\nLet me start by reading the relevant skills and the git state. Let me plan:\n\n1. Read `.agents/skills/netscript-harness/SKILL.md` and relevant harness workflow files (evaluator protocol)\n2. `gh issue view 1868` and `gh pr view 1883` for claims\n3. Look at the commits: `cd2337d36` (RED) and `04420a074` (GREEN), head `5bfd7c6be`\n4. Read the implementation (dev probe code)\n5. Run the gates\n6. Extract RED commit via git archive and re-run focused suite\n7. Reconstruct pre-fix probe behavior\n8. Check D1-D7\n9. Write verdict\n\nLet me start with parallel reads: git status/log, issue/PR views, harness skill.\n\nLet me begin.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Together","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d76c1e2-cc74-4e83-bb1d-246737fa683c","uuid":"48c128eb-a51f-42df-8a30-7af67e78c04d","timestamp":"2026-09-01T17:17:29.720Z","request_id":"gen-1788283046-syWhUNPjxWsXRNvGgqRD"}
